            "content_html": "<div>\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Google+Sans+Flex:opsz,wght@6..144,400..700&display=swap');\n\n.aatm-project {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 25px auto;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-details {\n  max-width: 850px;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-details h2 {\n  font-family: 'Google Sans Flex', sans-serif;\n  color: #f5f1e9;\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.8px;\n  line-height: 1.22;\n  margin: 0 0 14px;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-details p {\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  color: #d0cec9;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin: 0 0 22px;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-details h3 {\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  color: #c8ad82;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1.3px;\n  margin: 28px 0 12px;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-video {\n  width: 100%;\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  background: #000;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.aatm-project-video iframe {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: calc(75cqw + 24px);\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.aatm-episode {\n  margin-top: 28px;\n}\n\n.aatm-episode h3 {\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  color: #c8ad82;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1.3px;\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n}\n\n.aatm-role {\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.aatm-role ul {\n  padding-left: 18px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.aatm-role li {\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  color: #e0ddd7;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin-bottom: 9px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n  .aatm-project-details h2 {\n    font-size: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .aatm-role {\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aatm-project\">\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-project-details\">\n    <h2>Aatm Nirbhar | Mardon Wale Kaam</h2>\n\n    <p>\n      A four-episode content series developed through Aatm Nirbhar. My involvement extended across research, content development, participant interviews, pre-production, production coordination and post-production supervision.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-episode\">\n    <h3>EPISODE 1</h3>\n    <div class=\"aatm-project-video\">\n      <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"         src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JptimovDE-pAC2EaREeGd9hplt9aUlQs/preview\"\n        width=\"640\"\n        height=\"480\"\n        allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\"\n        allowfullscreen>\n      </iframe></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-episode\">\n    <h3>EPISODE 2</h3>\n    <div class=\"aatm-project-video\">\n      <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"         src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Fwe3lEUkYQcMAChJlYFmhK_LKHIQtUWs/preview\"\n        width=\"640\"\n        height=\"480\"\n        allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\"\n        allowfullscreen>\n      </iframe></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-episode\">\n    <h3>EPISODE 3</h3>\n    <div class=\"aatm-project-video\">\n      <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"         src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1h2KL5ONBu-BAmEpwGDE0fdykNMJy9dJD/preview\"\n        width=\"640\"\n        height=\"480\"\n        allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\"\n        allowfullscreen>\n      </iframe></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-episode\">\n    <h3>EPISODE 4</h3>\n    <div class=\"aatm-project-video\">\n      <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"         src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WbxJWg5AZvgx7SfcEoqWpZ_f8ZlsrqmW/preview\"\n        width=\"640\"\n        height=\"480\"\n        allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\"\n        allowfullscreen>\n      </iframe></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aatm-project-details aatm-role\">\n    <h3>MY ROLE & CONTRIBUTION</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Research and content development for the series.</li>\n      <li>Identifying, meeting and interviewing participants.</li>\n      <li>Scriptwriting and preparing questions and talking points for the host.</li>\n      <li>End-to-end pre-production planning and coordination.</li>\n      <li>Coordinating with the shooting team and managing production requirements.</li>\n      <li>Coordinating with partner companies including Swiggy, Rapido, DeHaat and Instamart.</li>\n      <li>Managing communication and coordination to ensure smooth production.</li>\n      <li>Working with the editor, reviewing edits, providing feedback and overseeing repeated revisions through final delivery.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>",
